{
  "description": "Attachment verb rules. Each case runs `code` as Python with the five verbs `attach`, `list_attachments`, `get_attachment`, `read_attachment` and `show_attachment` in an empty store. The code needs bytes only, or the directory `.`, and puts the result in `out`. `expect` is the answer of the engine. For a value, `value` is the whole JSON value of `out`, with each attachment id written as `<id>`. For a refusal, `error` is the class name and `message` is its text. The engine test `door-parity-test` runs each case in `python_execution`, in a sandbox worker and in a real extension worker. The SDK test `test_attach_parity.py` runs each case on the host outside Vis. Where that host answers differently, the case has an `outside` object with a `reason` (a key of `exceptions`) and its own `expect`.",
  "exceptions": {
    "audience": "Outside Vis, no rule keeps a document for the user only. The audience is the one that the call names, else `both`.",
    "position": "Outside Vis, the descriptor that a read verb returns has no `position` key.",
    "error-class": "In Vis, a refusal of the engine is `VisToolError`, a `RuntimeError`. Outside Vis that class does not exist: the refusal is a `RuntimeError` with the same words.",
    "bytes": "Outside Vis, the bytes of a payload do not name its media type: the filename and the call name it. The kind and the audience follow as `document` and `audience` say.",
    "document": "Outside Vis, no rule gives the kind `doc`. The kind is the one that the call names, else `file`, and the audience is the one that the call names, else `both`."
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "attach-bytes",
      "code": [
        "out = attach(b'a,b\\n1,2\\n', 'totals.csv', label='Totals')"
      ],
      "expect": {
        "value": {
          "audience": "user",
          "filename": "totals.csv",
          "id": "<id>",
          "is_pending": true,
          "kind": "file",
          "media_type": "text/csv",
          "size": 8,
          "source": "tool",
          "version": 1
        }
      },
      "outside": {
        "reason": "audience",
        "expect": {
          "value": {
            "audience": "both",
            "filename": "totals.csv",
            "id": "<id>",
            "is_pending": true,
            "kind": "file",
            "media_type": "text/csv",
            "size": 8,
            "source": "tool",
            "version": 1
          }
        }
      }
    },
